    "dcterms:description": [
        {
            "@value": "19世紀末から20世紀初頭にかけて企画された、インド・アーリア語文献学に関わる諸分野を簡潔かつ体系的に概観する叢書の一冊。本書はヴェーダ語・サンスクリット語の統語論を扱う。本学ではエリオット文庫所収。One of a series of books published in the late 19th and early 20th centuries to provide a concise and systematic overview of the various fields involved in Indo-Aryan philology. This book deals with Vedic and Sanskrit syntax It is included in the Eliot Collection.",
            "is_public": true,
            "property_id": 4,
            "property_label": "Description",
            "type": "literal"
        }
